('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <b>Name: Kropri\u2019ra (goes by Hasya)<br /> Concept: Assassin turned peaceful Shaman<br /> Archetype: Priest<br /> Profession: Shaman<br /> Motivation:</b> Live in peace and make others live in peace<br /> <b>Intimacies: </b>Pakari (Deference, Respect), The gods (Reverence), Temple Guardians (Respect, Mild distrust)<br /> <br /> <b>Attributes:</b><br /> -Strength: *<br /> -Dexterity: ***<br /> -Stamina: **<br /> -Charisma:***<br /> -Manipulation:***<br /> -Appearance:*<br /> -Perception:**<br /> -Intelligence:****<br /> -Wits:****<br /> <br /> <b>Abilities:</b><br /> -Archery:<br /> -Melee: ** (Specialty: Daggers and Knives *)<br /> -Martial Arts:<br /> -Thrown:<br /> -War:<br /> -Integrity:<br /> -Presence:<br /> -Performance:**<br /> -Resistance:**<br /> -Survival: *** (Speciality: Poisons **)<br /> -Lore (F): ****<br /> -Occult: **<br /> -Investigation:<br /> -Craft (water): ***<br /> -Medicine: **<br /> -Athletics:<br /> -Awareness: **<br /> -Dodge:<br /> -Larceny: *<br /> -Stealth: ***<br /> -Bureaucracy:*<br /> -Ride:*<br /> -Sail:*<br /> -Socialize:**<br /> -Linguistics:<br /> <br /> <b>General<br /> Virtues:</b><br /> -Compassion: **<br /> -Conviction:****<br /> -Temperance:**<br /> -Valor:**<br /> -Willpower: ******<br /> -Essence: *<br /> <b>Health Levels</b><br /> -1x -0<br /> -2x -1<br /> -2x -2<br /> -1x -4<br /> -Incapacitated<br /> -X dying<br /> <br /> <b>Backgrounds</b><br /> -Backing (Temple Guardians) **<br /> -Contacts (Temple Guardians) *<br /> <br /> <b>Merits:</b><br /> -Priest: *<br /> -Favored Weapon (Daggers and Knives): **<br /> -Acute Sense (taste):*<br /> -Acute Sense (smell):*<br /> <br /> <b>Bonus Points were spent:</b><br /> 4 points on 1 dot in Wits<br /> 4 points on 2 dot in Resistance<br /> 2 points on 1 extra dot in Stealth<br /> 1 point on Priest Merit:<br /> 1 point on Acute Taste:<br /> 1 point on Acute Smell:<br /> 2 points on Favored Weapon (Daggers and Knives)<br /> 3 points on 1 extra compassion, he\u2019s not THAT coldhearted<br /> 3 points on his Specialties<br /> <br /> Appearance:<br /> Old, completely bald. Very dark, wrinkly skin. He's got thin shoulders and thin limbs, and if it wasn't for the wooden staff that he supports himself on (one of the few things that looks more gnarled than he does), you'd think he'd wouldn't be able to stand. He generally wears the cloth of the Temple Guardians, as well as carrying a satchel with various things he might need for his rituals. He never wears shoes. He generally wears some bright colored facepaint in horizontal stripes above and below his eyes. His eyes are a very light color blue, almost like seawater.<br /> To summarize, the years, and the guilt, have not been kind to this man.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I made some Martial Arts for 3e, look at them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723442-survival-is-fury-the-monster-reborn-ex3\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> and <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/761356-orgiastic-fugitive-style-3e\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/632-while-my-guitar","name":"While My Guitar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar632_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-12T06:05:16-07:00","id":278770,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/225772-ooc-exalted-the-whitestone-island-campaign?p=277887#post277887\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Guess I just gonna play with myself and the Maiden then, it's sketching time !<br /> <br /> So...what does Pakari look like anyway, long/short hair, wavy/straight hair ? Gigantic and board-shoulder like Demetheus or average height but have a stocky build like Strength-of-Many ? Baby-faced or stubble hunk with sharp jawline ?<br /> <br /> Ahem.....does he wear a shirt.</div> </div> </div> </div>I described him earlier. - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/225772-ooc-exalted-the-whitestone-island-campaign?p=232785#post232785\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/g...785#post232785</a><br /> <br /> He's has short, straight hair, he is more of the giant and broad type*, kind of stubbly, and no, he doesn't usually wear a shirt. He is rarely without his Guardian sash, though.<br /> <br /> *Not like a body-builder though. He'll be less toned than that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>On the frontier of the Wild South, there's only one woman with the grit to take on its most dangerous outlaws and bring them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/984977-back-alive-or-maybe-dead-quest\" target=\"_blank\">Back Alive, or Maybe Dead.</a><br /> <br /> Avatar by <a href=\"http://puzzlinghappenstance.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">K.S. Brenowitz</a>","edited":{"userid":908,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","user":"semicasual","date":". 10-12-2014, 09:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","name":"semicasual","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar908_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-12T16:28:51-07:00","id":279155,"title":"","content":"I like it! I'll do your starting post when I do my story-update tonight.<br /> <br /> Edit: On second thought...Hasya should maybe consider taking some Warding stuff. Either knowing some Warding rituals or having an occult specialty in the maintenance of other people's wards would help explain why he's the one checking on this dangerous tomb and why he sent Pakari off for warding ingredients. I'm willing to let you maintain a ward someone else has set up without knowing the ritual with a decent Occult roll.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":512,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","user":"Wise Old Guru","date":". 10-13-2014, 03:58 AM"},"attachments":[],"rea