l situation and for another reason... The Bearer is following you but being stealthy, I'm sorta hoping for some conversation between the two of you during your transit time but her being stealthy might get in the way of that...<br /> <br /> The Calm Sea Village Posse (which now includes Wahine and Seskan in addition to Huelo Fokisi) is free to talk to each other and interact as they see fit. We'll be bringing them together with the Maiden soon, probably having her ship weigh anchor in the bay and send a rowboat with the Maiden and a couple others to speak to the people on shore. RL comes first, though, so no worries if you're a bit slow. I'm here for the long haul on this game and hopefully the rest of us are too, there's no rush.<br /> <br /> Random note: it's looking like we may have another player joining us soon. Got a PM from an old friend of mine interested in taking up the abandoned &quot;sea folk PC&quot; slot, and since I already had a small pile of Sea Folk Plot sitting around, I'll probably let him in. Won't affect anyone much for a while, he'll be doing solo seafolk stuff out in the ocean for a while before he meets up with anyone...or maybe I'll throw him in a river in Pakari's path just to get things moving a bit, we'll see.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Post