y and the islanders is MIA. I mean, I can have him fade into the background in the scene where his long-lost sister comes to shore and let NPC prettyboy Haku take the lead on these talks, but I sorta had this whole &quot;reuniting lost siblings and maybe trying to reclaim the monarchy with foreign guns&quot; thing planned? So I'm gonna give our missing boys in that scene some time to show before I start moving it forward.<br /> <br /> I'll be sending out some PMs by this weekend to people who haven't posted in a while, seeing if they're actually dropping out or if they've just not noticed updates due to the slow pace of the game. If it's the former, I'll do some recruiting to see if we can get other players to take on their roles, or take on other roles in the story, to keep things moving (by &quot;moving,&quot; please understand that I mean &quot;plodding glacially,&quot; this thing ain't gonna suddenly start going fast) forward.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-29T09:26:57-08:00","id":385168,"title":"","content":"In fairness, I think the MG has been off the forums for a month.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>On the frontier of the Wild South, there's only one woman with the grit to take on its most